Z||000000||gtsonly||08-21-2000||04:37 PM||||for all of you on tight budget but want the best for your buck, try autozone parts store. i have been having problems with oil consumption on my fiero. i boroscoped my engine and found lots of carbon deposits throughout the engine. being of tight pockets, i went to autozone parts store and talked to one of there people and discribed my situation. he recommended a product called RXP de-carbonizer. 2.5 oz bottle that treats 25 gallons of gas. yes an additive, but man did it make a difference. power is back, smoke is almost completely gone. 6.99$ for the bottle. i will be boroscoping the engine once again after i complete the bottle and let you all know the results but so far i like what i feel!!!<BR>  chris hatch<BR> 1986.5 gt with t-tops||||reg||14
Z||000001||cscougar||08-21-2000||04:40 PM||||I have used RXP in 3 Fieros so far and have had excellent results.  Especially on one that had sat for 3 years.  After using the bottle on two tanks of gas, the car had alot more power.||||reg||1
